{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "008rei_403_2_4_008_03_09_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:94a57e060bb50982ab367f54c1ca99002e9fb25ca47d8e356733330db9152176",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:008rei_403_2_4_008_03_09_a:2_4_008_03_09_a:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c57be8f2488ef7d82c1912df75ab99fbe48be13c1d2cf1f7be1be427432288e9",
      "text": "这么晚打扰你真是不好意思。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:008rei_403_2_4_008_03_09_a:2_4_008_03_09_a:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3693a0304d913ec5ffaba729dc2b7c9388021a3b072febcfbdff69f2c583f7b2",
      "text": "一想起今天的拍摄，\n我就怎么也睡不着了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:008rei_403_2_4_008_03_09_a:2_4_008_03_09_a:cmd-000010:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ab443e3025a3019e54d916d3f4fd5d9922d3f8674361c5976438983b71f8104e",
      "text": "成功做出练习已久的动作的那一瞬间，\n那种亢奋感深深烙印在心中挥之不去。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:008rei_403_2_4_008_03_09_a:2_4_008_03_09_a:cmd-000012:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:299ad0286b1096f603608b4182c626db2a24ae6a2b46d02031c9d8417bd56c94",
      "text": "选手们一定也是怀揣着这样的感动，\n不断发起挑战的吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:008rei_403_2_4_008_03_09_a:2_4_008_03_09_a:cmd-000014:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a546a0297e7685d6644876bd248fed449f622c46f8dbc483cc5efb6238e9c6f1",
      "text": "阁下为我商量了许多对策，\n我也心怀感激。请容我再次向你道谢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:008rei_403_2_4_008_03_09_a:2_4_008_03_09_a:cmd-000016:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ca1eac95e8c7c0335efb44310623c335eed3168a1ba5fdc78de040aac398c0e6",
      "text": "多亏了你，我遇到了一个好搭档……\n就是那块滑板。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:008rei_403_2_4_008_03_09_a:2_4_008_03_09_a:cmd-000018:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ff4af7e3a5f40eba8d5193792babaa36a77269dc2b51a09f8d058ba1c5cb8cea",
      "text": "能找到好搭档\n真是太好了",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:008rei_403_2_4_008_03_09_a:2_4_008_03_09_a:cmd-000019:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cebf2db710a2769372e9d51b58d076ff9113f62015f326a03de84d4068f6e808",
      "text": "滑板\n好玩吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:008rei_403_2_4_008_03_09_a:2_4_008_03_09_a:cmd-000022:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6ab23659e81b4d3cd176b78018f7f1123b15a6919a9b475e63a1ca90bd1a0396",
      "text": "我本以为这只是一次性的短暂相遇……不过今后\n我也想抽出时间，用那块滑板滑行。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:008rei_403_2_4_008_03_09_a:2_4_008_03_09_a:cmd-000027:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ea3e3e9188915c3e3d2ff4b9104d7af3c9c9ba6cc9fb4e7d7e9b098528d16d17",
      "text": "嗯，我觉得我以自己的方式体会到了乐趣。\n和大家一起去公园的日子，也很新鲜。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:008rei_403_2_4_008_03_09_a:2_4_008_03_09_a:cmd-000031:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:06776151db8ac8854d6cbe0898c71539844879d93febbc23aa16a326f18b5836",
      "text": "我们马上就约好下次再去滑了。\n趁着好不容易掌握的诀窍还没忘掉。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:008rei_403_2_4_008_03_09_a:2_4_008_03_09_a:cmd-000033:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3ad61fafdc8ca17dbf167e119f999b1306dc34000b0ab0b8b30e90ad7454aec7",
      "text": "今后只要还有挑战新事物的机会，\n我就会回想起这次的事，竭尽全力去做好。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:008rei_403_2_4_008_03_09_a:2_4_008_03_09_a:cmd-000035:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:edf8aefdb3ff5fcd60b2d694d629e6ef6416c4c968e8c33b1049bbcbdfae2027",
      "text": "……已经这个时间了吗。不知不觉聊太久了。\n那么，明天起的工作也拜托你了。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
